# eval/report.json and eval/pr_curve.png are committed on purpose: they're
# deterministic (fixed seed) outputs the deployed /metrics and
# /pr-curve.png endpoints serve directly, and Vercel's build doesn't run
# eval/evaluate.py. Regenerate locally with `python eval/evaluate.py`
# after any change to data/generate_data.py, app/scoring.py, or
# app/decision.py, then re-commit.
